<p><%= @client_name %> 様</p>

<p><strong><%= @headline %></strong></p>

<% Array(@body_lines).each do |line| %>
  <p><%= line %></p>
<% end %>

<% if @show_offer %>
  <p>
    <strong><%= t("drafity.trial_nurture.offer_badge") %></strong><br>
    <%= t("drafity.trial_nurture.offer_title", percent: @percent_off, months: @months) %><br>
    <%= t("drafity.trial_nurture.offer_price", list: @list_price, sale: @sale_price) %>
    <% if @offer_expires_at.present? %>
      <br><%= t("drafity.trial_nurture.offer_deadline", date: format_mail_date(@offer_expires_at)) %>
    <% end %>
  </p>
<% end %>

<% if @trial_ends_at.present? %>
  <p><%= t("drafity.trial_nurture.trial_ends", date: format_mail_date(@trial_ends_at)) %></p>
<% end %>

<p><a href="<%= @cta_url %>"><%= @cta_label %></a></p>
<p>ご不明な点がございましたら、<a href="mailto:info@j-work.jp">info@j-work.jp</a> までお問い合わせください。</p>
<p>株式会社J Work</p>
